01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
3000 Miles to Graceland is a 2001 American action crime film
directed and co-produced by Demian Lichtenstein.

13
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:21,000
The original script was written by Richard Recco and Demian
Lichtenstein shares a co-writing credit on the final film.

14
